---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="China Travel Routes: 7 Itineraries by Days and Style | YOGOTOCHINA" 
  description="Seven China travel routes with city lists, day counts, and who each one suits. Find the itinerary that fits your trip length and travel style."
>
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem;">

    <!-- 返回链接 -->
    <a href="/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: #6c757d; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem;">
      <span>←</span> Back to Home
    </a>

    <!-- ===== 标题区 ===== -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2A2E; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin: 0 0 1rem 0; line-height: 1.2;">
        China Travel Routes: 7 Itineraries by Days and Style
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
        Seven routes, built from what travelers actually do in China. Each card shows the cities, the days, and who it suits. Short on time? Tech and Slow Travel are the shortest routes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== 七条路线卡片 ===== -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">

      <!-- 1. Culture -->
      <a href="/theme/culture/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/culture/culture-beijing-forbidden-city-palace-museum-china.webp" alt="Forbidden City in Beijing, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Beijing, Xi'an &amp; Chengdu</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">First trip · History · 15–20 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For first-time visitors who want the classic China: imperial capitals, the Great Wall, Terracotta Warriors, and pandas.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 2. Tech -->
      <a href="/theme/tech/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/tech/tech-chongqing-hongyadong-night-cyberpunk-china.webp" alt="Hongyadong in Chongqing at night, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Chongqing &amp; Shenzhen</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">Short trip · Cities · Neon · 7–10 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For travelers short on time who want neon skylines, monorails through buildings, and China's tech hubs.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 3. Family -->
      <a href="/theme/family/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/family/family-chengdu-panda-base-giant-panda-china.webp" alt="Giant panda at the Chengdu Panda Base, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Chengdu, Shanghai &amp; Sanya</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">With kids · Pandas · Beach · 12–16 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For families with kids: pandas in the morning, Shanghai Disneyland, and a beach finish in Sanya.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 4. Food -->
      <a href="/theme/food/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/food/food-hotpot-china.webp" alt="Chinese hotpot feast" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Xi'an, Chengdu &amp; Guangzhou</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">Food-first ·Street food· 14–18 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For travelers who plan trips around food: hand-pulled noodles, Sichuan hotpot, and Cantonese dim sum.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 5. Nature -->
      <a href="/theme/nature/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/nature/nature-zhangjiajie-tianmen-mountain-cave-china.webp" alt="Tianmen Mountain in Zhangjiajie, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Zhangjiajie, Guilin &amp; Jiuzhaigou</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">Landscapes · Hiking · 10–12 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For travelers who want China's most dramatic landscapes: Avatar mountains, karst rivers, and turquoise lakes.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 6. Outdoor -->
      <a href="/theme/outdoor/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/outdoor/outdoor-xinjiang-yurt-grassland-mountains-china.webp" alt="Yurt on the grassland in Xinjiang, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Yangshuo, Siguniang &amp; Xinjiang</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">Adventure · Climbing · 15–20 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For adventurous travelers: rock climbing on karst cliffs, alpine hiking below snow peaks, and Silk Road history.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 7. Slow Travel -->
      <a href="/theme/slow/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: flex;">
        <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #E2E0D4; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <img src="/images/theme/slow/slow-suzhou-classical-garden-pavilion-china.webp" alt="Classical garden in Suzhou, China" loading="lazy" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;">
          <div style="padding: 1.2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 0.3rem 0; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700;">Suzhou, Hangzhou &amp; Wuzhen</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600;">Unhurried · Gardens · 5–7 days</p>
            <p style="margin: 0 0 1rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1;">For travelers who want to slow down: classical gardens, canal towns, tea terraces, and no rush.</p>
            <span style="display: inline-block; background-color: #2D6A4F; color: white; padding: 0.3rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; align-self: flex-start;">See the route →</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>

    <!-- ===== 底部引导 ===== -->
    <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #1F2A2E; margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; font-weight: 600;">
        Found a route you like?
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #6c757d; margin: 0 0 1.2rem 0;">
        Get your payments, eSIM, and transport ready before you go.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/china-travel-checklist/" style="display: inline-block; background: #2D6A4F; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 0.7rem 2rem; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        China Travel Checklist →
      </a>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6c757d; margin: 0;">
        Not sure yet? <a href="/tours/" style="color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">See how to choose a China tour</a> or <a href="https://www.trip.com/webapp/tripmap/tripplanner?source=t_online_homepage&locale=en-XX&curr=USD&Allianceid=5609710&SID=130343298&trip_sub1=&trip_sub3=D18535988" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored nofollow" style="color: #2D6A4F; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">try Trip.com's AI planner</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  body {
    background: #F8F6F0;
  }
</style>